    "detailed_description": "Queer &amp; Chill is a spicy and challenging puzzle full of pride flags, and lots of diversity. Improve your skills while discovering new and exciting ways to match people based on their sexuality. <br>Learn, evolve, and most of all, be curious.<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><br><strong>Party After Party: </strong><br>Test your match skills with more than 80 levels and challenges.<br><br><strong>Charming by Nature :</strong><br>People of all shades, sizes and colors.<br><br><strong>Rainbow Celebration:</strong><br>Discover different gender identities and sexualities: demisexual, asexual, autosexual, pansexual, abrosexual and aromantic people will be coloring the party with their pride flags.<br><br><strong>Dress Code:</strong><br>Unlock spicy and funny styles to dress up your parties, from Victorian underwear to furry characters and more.<br><br><strong>&quot;Do you need my help?&quot;</strong><br>You can talk about gender identity, sexuality and another things with a companion to learn more about the game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587800/extras/1c060aecdbe5d2785e101ece4eeaa755.poster.avif?t=1670362788\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587800/extras/1c060aecdbe5d2785e101ece4eeaa755.webm?t=1670362788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587800/extras/1c060aecdbe5d2785e101ece4eeaa755.mp4?t=1670362788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Queer &amp; Chill is a spicy and challenging puzzle full of pride flags, and lots of diversity. Improve your skills while discovering new and exciting ways to match people based on their sexuality. <br>Learn, evolve, and most of all, be curious.<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><br><strong>Party After Party: </strong><br>Test your match skills with more than 80 levels and challenges.<br><br><strong>Charming by Nature :</strong><br>People of all shades, sizes and colors.<br><br><strong>Rainbow Celebration:</strong><br>Discover different gender identities and sexualities: demisexual, asexual, autosexual, pansexual, abrosexual and aromantic people will be coloring the party with their pride flags.<br><br><strong>Dress Code:</strong><br>Unlock spicy and funny styles to dress up your parties, from Victorian underwear to furry characters and more.<br><br><strong>&quot;Do you need my help?&quot;</strong><br>You can talk about gender identity, sexuality and another things with a companion to learn more about the game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587800/extras/1c060aecdbe5d2785e101ece4eeaa755.poster.avif?t=1670362788\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587800/extras/1c060aecdbe5d2785e101ece4eeaa755.webm?t=1670362788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587800/extras/1c060aecdbe5d2785e101ece4eeaa755.mp4?t=1670362788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
